{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_66195313","title":"Thaddeus Meeting 2","entry":"Dlg_66195313::entry","exit":"Dlg_66195313::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_63833379","articyId":"72057602627863562","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"So you got the place all set up. Nice! I should have decorated a looooong time ago.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you got the place all set up. Nice! I should have decorated a looooong time ago.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17949","byteOffset":14679280,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_EB43A992","articyId":"72057602627863582","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"I'm just here to say goodbye.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm just here to say goodbye.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26435","byteOffset":17882504,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_8A8F4EEA","articyId":"72057602627863597","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Not to you! To the noodle bar. I barely know you, but this place... it's like a mold I was poured into. It shaped my soul.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not to you! To the noodle bar. I barely know you, but this place... it's like a mold I was poured into. It shaped my soul.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43960","byteOffset":30964880,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_005CAEC4","articyId":"72057602627863618","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"I am. I can't wait to get there.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am. I can't wait to get there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51235","byteOffset":33796224,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_6A8BE303","articyId":"72057602627863623","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"The work? No. Nivalis? Also no. I'm never coming back.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The work? No. Nivalis? Also no. I'm never coming back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41805","byteOffset":30143128,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_823D20D8","articyId":"72057602627863646","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"That's not for you to know right now. But I'll keep tabs on you. One way or another, I'll know what happens here. If you look after the place... well maybe I'll send that postcard. With a real pretty picture on it.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's not for you to know right now. But I'll keep tabs on you. One way or another, I'll know what happens here. If you look after the place... well maybe I'll send that postcard. With a real pretty picture on it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48825","byteOffset":32809192,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_6049CDFC","articyId":"72057602627863668","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Well, this noodle bar ain't exactly a license to print money. Just listen to old Banor. He'll keep you right.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, this noodle bar ain't exactly a license to print money. Just listen to old Banor. He'll keep you right.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41319","byteOffset":29958896,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_0CCAA18E","articyId":"72057602627863682","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Don't flatter yourself kid. To be honest with ya, I just don't care that much. This noodle bar ain't exactly a license to print money. If you want to stay in business longer than a week, you listen to old Banor, you hear?","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Don't flatter yourself kid. To be honest with ya, I just don't care that much. This noodle bar ain't exactly a license to print money. If you want to stay in business longer than a week, you listen to old Banor, you hear?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45904","byteOffset":31698432,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_D8346D04","articyId":"72057602627863690","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"He's your right hand man. You're the boss now. Can't be doing everything yourself, right? I see you hired some staff and moved some tables too. Good start. Keep it up.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He's your right hand man. You're the boss now. Can't be doing everything yourself, right? I see you hired some staff and moved some tables too. Good start. Keep it up.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31317","byteOffset":19727720,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_B1723DE5","articyId":"72057602627863704","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Well, that's about everything. I gotta go, kid. I got one last bit of free advice for you, if you want it?","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, that's about everything. I gotta go, kid. I got one last bit of free advice for you, if you want it?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34404","byteOffset":20898776,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_39FD9AAC","articyId":"72057602627863726","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"When you live and work in Nivalis, you're eventually gonna have to make a choice. You gotta lift people up, or you gotta climb on top of them. If you lift them up, most likely none of you get very far. But maybe you keep some folks head above the water line.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"When you live and work in Nivalis, you're eventually gonna have to make a choice. You gotta lift people up, or you gotta climb on top of them. If you lift them up, most likely none of you get very far. But maybe you keep some folks head above the water line.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":-175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38337","byteOffset":28838560,"byteLength":584}},{"id":"DFr_38ED7CDA","articyId":"72057602627863733","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Alright then. Well, I don't do goodbyes. I need to leave Nivalis before it sucks the life out of my bones. I'll be in touch kid. Maybe. Goodbye.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright then. Well, I don't do goodbyes. I need to leave Nivalis before it sucks the life out of my bones. I'll be in touch kid. Maybe. Goodbye.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6200.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44108","byteOffset":31021064,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_DC8673FA","articyId":"72057834556099990","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Or if you climb on them, well, you can make it all the way to the top. All the way to the Spire! But you gotta choose. You gotta be kind, or you gotta climb. Neither one is right or wrong. But CHOOSING is what matters. Make a choice kid. Be kind or climb.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Or if you climb on them, well, you can make it all the way to the top. All the way to the Spire! But you gotta choose. You gotta be kind, or you gotta climb. Neither one is right or wrong. But CHOOSING is what matters. Make a choice kid. Be kind or climb.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5525.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28076","byteOffset":18504232,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_E1002